msgstr ""
"Kodeci su instalirani. Počinju raditi nakon ponovnog pokretanja, što "
"kontrolna lista za podešavanje nudi na kraju."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed.\\n\\nRecommended: Restart now to start using them. "
"Or Later."
msgstr ""
"Kodeci su instalirani.\\n\\nPreporučeno: Ponovo pokreni sada, da ih počnete "
"koristiti. Ili Kasnije."

msgid "The codecs are removed. Restart to finish."
msgstr ""
"Kodeci su uklonjeni. Ponovo pokrenite računar da biste dovršili postupak."

msgid "The codecs weren't removed."
msgstr "Kodeci nisu uklonjeni."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The computer didn't start properly with the boot options changed in "
"Wheelhouse, so it went back to the version from {since}, with the boot "
