#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"This really deletes these files from this computer: the user accounts and passwords (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), the list of disks (/etc/fstab), the login rules (/etc/pam.d) and the administrator rules (/etc/sudoers). Your own files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Save your work and close your apps first: the computer restarts as soon as they're deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If putting them back doesn't work: when a start hangs or stays broken, hold the power button until the computer turns off, then turn it on. After 2 bad starts, the next start is the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, which has its own copy of these settings."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Ovo zaista briše ove datoteke s ovog računara: korisničke račune i lozinke (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), listu diskova (/etc/fstab), pravila za prijavu (/etc/pam.d) i pravila za administratore (/etc/sudoers). Vaše vlastite datoteke i aplikacije ostaju netaknute.\n"
"\n"
"Prvo sačuvajte svoj rad i zatvorite aplikacije: računar se ponovo pokreće čim se izbrišu.\n"
"\n"
"Ako njihovo vraćanje ne uspije: kada se pokretanje zaglavi ili ostane neispravno, držite dugme za uključivanje dok se računar ne isključi, a zatim ga uključite. Nakon 2 neuspjela pokretanja, sljedeće pokretanje je ranija verzija sačuvana za Poništi posljednje ažuriranje, koja ima vlastitu kopiju ovih postavki."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"When it comes back, a message says the test worked, and the test copy is removed. Don't turn the computer off during the test unless the steps say to. {save}\n"
"\n"
"The test copy takes the place of the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, so Undo has nothing to go back to until the next update."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Kada se vrati, poruka kaže da je test uspio, a testna kopija se uklanja. Ne isključujte računar tokom testa, osim ako koraci to ne kažu. {save}\n"
"\n"
"Testna kopija zauzima mjesto ranije verzije sačuvane za Poništi posljednje ažuriranje, pa Poništi nema na šta da se vrati do sljedećeg ažuriranja."

